    "title": "Background Eraser",
    "description": "This is an application for cutting pictures and for making a picture's background transparent.\r\n\r\nThe resulting images can be used as stickers with other apps to make a photomontage, collage.\r\n\r\n\r\n- - - Features - - -\r\n\r\n\"Magic\" mode\r\n- Detects image edges to erase easily & accurately.\r\n\r\n\"Auto\" or \"Color\" mode\r\n- Erases similar pixels automatically.\r\n\r\nIt's very important to make a picture's background transparent accurately\r\nif you want to superimpose photos and make good composite photos.\r\n\r\nBy using this app, you can do it better.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is an application for cutting pictures and for making a picture&#39;s background transparent.<br><br>The resulting images can be used as stickers with other apps to make a photomontage, collage.<br><br><br>- - - Features - - -<br><br>&quot;Magic&quot; mode<br>- Detects image edges to erase easily &amp; accurately.<br><br>&quot;Auto&quot; or &quot;Color&quot; mode<br>- Erases similar pixels automatically.<br><br>It&#39;s very important to make a picture&#39;s background transparent accurately<br>if you want to superimpose photos and make good composite photos.<br><br>By using this app, you can do it better.",
